/**
 * Test-only helpers for isolating the shared in-memory SQLite database between
 * tests and between module-cache resets.
 *
 * The libsql client used in tests points at `file::memory:?cache=shared`, which
 * keeps a single in-memory database alive for as long as *any* connection to it
